[{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"我这边是海豚ai学的，我来给小朋友解锁一下，学习内容的之前您是在忙是吧？然后我给小朋友就是解锁好了，他今天晚上回来就可以直接学了这样的。","startTime":"200","endTime":"12100"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"我我这边需要先了解一下小朋友在校内的一个情况，然后给他安排好适合他的难度。","startTime":"12300","endTime":"19600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"还有内容，这样的。","startTime":"19800","endTime":"21000"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那小朋友最近在学校。他有考试过吗？","startTime":"21200","endTime":"23800"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"就是有，测试。","startTime":"25800","endTime":"27200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"考试","startTime":"27600","endTime":"28200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"您下载吗。","startTime":"29000","endTime":"30600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"什么","startTime":"31600","endTime":"32200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"他具体的话，最近在学校考试或者测试考了多少分？我根据他的情况给他安排难度。","startTime":"33600","endTime":"40600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"还的内容。","startTime":"41000","endTime":"41800"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"您清楚吗？","startTime":"44200","endTime":"46200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"分数，不是特别稳定。","startTime":"46800","endTime":"49200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"好，没关系，您和我说一个大致的一个分数。","startTime":"50800","endTime":"53800"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"670分，数学和英语都是这样子的是吧？好，他的满分是120分吗？","startTime":"56600","endTime":"64400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"是吗？一百分，一百分。","startTime":"65000","endTime":"71000"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"好，那我了解了那小朋友，他就是说主要失分比较多，或者说他自己学起来比较难的一些知识点有没有和您说过？","startTime":"71400","endTime":"83200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"好","startTime":"83800","endTime":"84200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"基础分丢的多，后面大题能做出来吗？他就是简单的，就是容易算错，或者容易马虎做错，然后后面大难一点的题，他反而能做出来。是吧。","startTime":"88000","endTime":"101800"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"好，那我了解了。","startTime":"102370","endTime":"103772"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那小朋友的话，他可能对基础知识定义掌握的不太好，但是它是一头脑还比比较灵活哈。","startTime":"103894","endTime":"110504"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"后面一些大题解题方法，方法和技巧掌握的都比较好。","startTime":"110626","endTime":"114008"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那我会根据他的情况给他安排适合他的内容和难度的这样的。","startTime":"114406","endTime":"119250"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"他是","startTime":"119350","endTime":"120450"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"他现在的话就是。是不是快期中考试了。","startTime":"120575","endTime":"123400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"好，我看咱们这边是人教版的小朋友，他现在就是学到哪个知识点了，您清楚吗？","startTime":"127600","endTime":"138400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"好的，那我这边的话就是先给他安排，就是说。","startTime":"139200","endTime":"143350"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"他适合他的内容去学，就是。","startTime":"144325","endTime":"147500"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"他他马上就要期中考试了，我们这边也安排了一些期中考试的一些重难点内容和一些压轴内容，然后我给他安排这方面的内容。让他学。","startTime":"147725","endTime":"157400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"你觉得可以不。","startTime":"157625","endTime":"158400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"看帮他就是说复习一下。","startTime":"160180","endTime":"162700"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"之前我，然后我们这边的话，也能检测出它具体是哪个知识点？","startTime":"162800","endTime":"167160"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"掌握的，不太好的。","startTime":"167340","endTime":"168540"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"因为我们这个是有这个。","startTime":"168640","endTime":"170550"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"每次他学了之后会有这个测试的，以及我看他这个入门测的情况。","startTime":"171320","endTime":"175930"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那妈妈，您看过他这个入门测试的情况吗？","startTime":"176080","endTime":"178800"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"好","startTime":"179200","endTime":"179600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"就就是好好，那那就是我这边是能看到他做的这个入门测试的，他入门测。","startTime":"181600","endTime":"190400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"入门测试的话，他他是得了五十分，然后的话，他前面一些实数平方根，这些立方根他掌握的都不太好，以及这个坐标轴这一块。他都有失分的情况。","startTime":"191020","endTime":"204940"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那他有没有？就是说他入门测试做完了之后有没有和您说过？","startTime":"205150","endTime":"211230"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"他觉得这这几个测试题难不难呢？","startTime":"211590","endTime":"214640"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"他觉得他觉得怎么样？这几个测试题难不难？因为我看他这个得分情况不是特别好。","startTime":"217200","endTime":"225200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"我","startTime":"226400","endTime":"227400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"所所以我就是根据他这个失分的一个情况去给他安排适合他的内容去学小朋友，他晚上回来就就可以学了孩子，他基本上晚上是九点多回来是吧。他。","startTime":"227800","endTime":"241200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"什么他？他是？晚上九点多回来吗？","startTime":"242680","endTime":"250720"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那你学完之后知道第二个。","startTime":"251180","endTime":"253130"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"都在家里是吧，那就是直接可以让他把这几个知识点内容完成了，给他安排的都是他做错了的一些题目。","startTime":"254620","endTime":"262540"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"就是说我们入门测里面，他这个平方根，还有实数这一块，他都是做错了。","startTime":"262640","endTime":"268000"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那我们就给他安排。","startTime":"268120","endTime":"269540"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"他薄弱的地方去给他学就可以了，是在这个学习计划里面，您看到了吗？","startTime":"269650","endTime":"274780"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"学习计划里面。","startTime":"275280","endTime":"276200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那我不需要。","startTime":"277600","endTime":"278200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"好，现在在忙是吧好，我这边先给您，就是说解锁，解锁好了，然后小朋友就是直接开可以学了，然后我们这边是有三个环节必须要完成的。我这边就是先和您简单说一下知识，它就小试牛刀和查漏补缺。","startTime":"281110","endTime":"296110"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"好，可以。可以。您大概什么时候回去，我带您去解锁。","startTime":"298000","endTime":"303200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"在","startTime":"303600","endTime":"304000"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"大概","startTime":"304400","endTime":"305200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"好，可以那行。行那好，那先不打扰您了。好拜拜。","startTime":"305800","endTime":"316080"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"对","startTime":"1800","endTime":"2200"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"嗯","startTime":"19400","endTime":"20200"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"有快","startTime":"21600","endTime":"23200"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"你","startTime":"23800","endTime":"24400"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"啊，平是是他的一思。","startTime":"26600","endTime":"29200"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"抄左呀。","startTime":"31800","endTime":"32800"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"那个分数，不一定呀。","startTime":"44400","endTime":"46800"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"你好","startTime":"48800","endTime":"49600"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"对","startTime":"50000","endTime":"50600"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"你十道不？这天。","startTime":"52400","endTime":"53600"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"就670分。","startTime":"55400","endTime":"56600"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"差不多。","startTime":"60400","endTime":"62000"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"谢谢","startTime":"64000","endTime":"65200"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"哦。不是。","startTime":"66400","endTime":"67400"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"不是","startTime":"67800","endTime":"68200"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"一百有时候是，就是九十，有时候七十。","startTime":"68600","endTime":"72400"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"哎呀，他就是基础分丢的多。","startTime":"85200","endTime":"87800"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"嗯